---
title: "volt — C4 level 2 (containers)"
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    classDef person    fill:#0b4f6c,stroke:#083a4f,color:#ffffff
    classDef container fill:#1168bd,stroke:#0b4884,color:#ffffff
    classDef store     fill:#2e7d32,stroke:#1b5e20,color:#ffffff
    classDef external  fill:#6c757d,stroke:#495057,color:#ffffff
    classDef boundary  fill:#f6f8fa,stroke:#8b949e,color:#24292f,stroke-dasharray:4 4

    client["<b>Professional Customer</b>
    <i>[Person — role CLIENT]</i>
    Browses, fills a cart, orders"]:::person

    admin["<b>Administrator</b>
    <i>[Person — role ADMIN]</i>
    Product CRUD, order status"]:::person

    subgraph volt["volt — B2B mini e-commerce platform"]
        direction TB

        spa["<b>Single-Page Application</b>
        <i>[React 19 · Vite · nginx :4200]</i>
        Catalog, detail, cart, orders, admin.
        Reverse-proxies both APIs, so the
        browser sees one origin and there
        is no CORS to configure."]:::container

        catalog["<b>catalog-service</b>
        <i>[Spring Boot 4 · Java 25 · :8081]</i>
        Source of truth for products,
        prices, stock and reservations.
        Hexagonal: domain / application /
        infrastructure"]:::container

        order["<b>order-service</b>
        <i>[Spring Boot 4 · Java 25 · :8082]</i>
        Carts and orders. Copies price and
        label onto order lines at checkout,
        so a past order never changes.
        Hexagonal: same layout"]:::container

        keycloak["<b>Keycloak</b>
        <i>[OIDC issuer · :8080]</i>
        Realm volt · roles CLIENT, ADMIN,
        SERVICE. Issues user tokens and the
        machine token order-service uses
        for /internal/**
        <i>ADR-0004 — absent from specification §3.1</i>"]:::external

        dbcat[("<b>db_catalog</b>
        <i>[PostgreSQL 18 · :5433]</i>
        category · brand · product
        reservation · reservation_line")]:::store

        dbord[("<b>db_order</b>
        <i>[PostgreSQL 18 · :5434]</i>
        cart · cart_line
        orders · order_line")]:::store
    end

    client -->|HTTPS| spa
    admin  -->|HTTPS| spa

    client -.->|"Auth code + PKCE"| keycloak
    admin  -.->|"Auth code + PKCE"| keycloak

    spa -->|"JSON/HTTPS
    /api/catalog/** (proxied)"| catalog
    spa -->|"JSON/HTTPS
    /api/orders/** (proxied)"| order

    order ==>|"<b>/internal/v1/stock/**</b>
    reserve → confirm · TTL 15 min
    Bearer: client-credentials token
    <i>ADR-0003 · ADR-0005</i>"| catalog

    catalog -->|JDBC| dbcat
    order   -->|JDBC| dbord

    catalog -.->|"Validates JWT via JWKS"| keycloak
    order   -.->|"Validates JWT ·
    obtains machine token"| keycloak

    class volt boundary
